 places de stationnement en sous-sol et des prestations de qualité complètent avantageusement l'offre de cette superbe résidence sécurisée.","addr":"Place des fontaines","gal":["https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjQ1OWY5NDMyNzQ1NzE3NWQ1MmM0YWI1YjAwZTg0YmEzODFkMTY5MWQiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiI4Y2M0Y2QyNzQ1NjViZWQ1YjYyM2E2Mjk2NjdiMjYzOCJ9?signature=4c90d723a4e7755144911e92d3e5f5c5a54436d27613d0f8da26abca49253ca9","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6ImYxYmI5YTdkYjYzNDZjYTViNWFkN2ZiYzBjNmUxZTM2MjJmNjE4ZGYiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiJmOGQ0MjMyOWE4Yzc0NjhjZTljYjE4MzYyOTg2OTVlNiJ9?signature=6ee6aebff3cb69674d098482a9a3aabaa3af9983bdb01c2b1a34031a9bfcd5e7","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjNjYjlkYWU1OTFkNDcwOGNmZDkxNjNjZjg3MGVkOThmMzgwOGRiMTAiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiJhNjJjOGQ0MDNiNzdkYjdmYTBhMTM1OGJmNmQ5YmVjMSJ9?signature=7bc117a6fdaf2e698d701cfca0bf9ad74841ddfa5ba7d630d98ef3d5dfdf863a","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjQ1MjUzNDc3MDIzNDQ1NzVjMDlmZjY2NTdiNjQxYmE4MzRkYWJiMmEiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiI4MjUxYmEzZTg1M2E1NTBjNThhYmVlYzIxYWRkZmNmNyJ9?signature=d6b8635e520328c59d48789402e72b55ef5bbc9c169ef4b411d0a775644e8c05","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjBhYjg3NGE5MmNkZDM3YWNjNjlkYTcwNDVkY2M1N2VjNGQ1NzFkMjMiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiI2N2VjYTc3NjE5NDE0ZDExNjhiMzI1MzJlZGVjMDg5MCJ9?signature=f5ae20bc79444242d93ce8ce7f04416bb8